 "words": 334,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Three months passed on the island shore",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We put to sea in Alexandria's hold",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Twin Brothers on the bow we saw",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Syracuse and Rhegium on the road",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Puteoli brothers welcomed us home",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven days we stayed before we roam",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To Rome where the Forum of Appius stood",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Paul saw them and thanked God for his blood",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He was allowed to live with his guard",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Three days later the leaders came to the yard",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He said I did nothing against our fathers",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet I was handed over to Caesar's doors",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am wearing this chain for the hope of Israel",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Laying out the kingdom of God before us",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From morning until evening he spoke the truth",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Convincing some while others remained in the booth",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They had no letters from Judea to show",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nor bad reports from the brothers below",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.96,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But they wanted to hear what he thought of the sect",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Spoken against in every part of the net",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So they set a day and came in crowds great",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To his lodging where the light was late",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From Moses and Prophets he tried to persuade",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "About Jesus with truth that they could not fade",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Some were convinced by the words he had spoken",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Others would not believe and the truth was broken",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They disagreed and began to leave",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With heated arguments in the heat",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am wearing this chain for the hope of Israel",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Laying out the kingdom of God before us",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From morning until evening he spoke the truth",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Convincing some while others remained in the booth",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Holy Spirit spoke through Isaiah's pen",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will listen and listen but never understand",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hearts have grown dull and eyes are shut tight",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So they may not see or hear the light",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God's salvation is sent to the Gentiles now",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And they will listen to the voice of the vow",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Two whole years in his rented place",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Proclaiming the kingdom with boldness and grace",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Without hindrance he taught the Lord",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "With complete boldness until the very end",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
 ],
